      {
        "id": "0c130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Record the times you actually start and finish work each day, including any time you work before or after your shift. Rest breaks of 20 minutes or less are paid and count as time worked. Record only meal breaks of 30 minutes or more, when you are fully relieved of duty, as unpaid, in minutes.",
